# Genesis MODsuit helmet localization
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetModsuitBase = base MOD helmet
    .desc = A helmet for a MODsuit.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetModsuitBlueShield = BlueShield MOD helmet
    .desc = A fancy, high-tech MODsuit designed for NanoTrasen's high-ranking officers.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetModsuitCorp = corporate MOD helmet
    .desc = A fancy, high-tech MODsuit designed for NanoTrasen's high-ranking officers.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetModsuitAdmin = administrative MOD helmet
    .desc = A MODsuit made of adminium. Who comes up with these stupid mineral names?
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetModsuitChrono = chrono MOD helmet
    .desc = A suit beyond our time, beyond time itself. Used to traverse timelines and “correct their course”.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetModsuitAtmospheric = atmospheric MOD helmet
    .desc = An atmospheric-resistant suit by Nakamura Engineering, offering extreme heat resistance compared to the engineer suit.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetModsuitClown = cosmohonk MOD helmet
    .desc = A suit by Honk Ltd. that protects against low-humor environments. Most of the technology went toward lowering its power consumption.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetModsuitEngineering = engineering MOD helmet
    .desc = Nakamura Engineering's classic engineer-fit suit, with heat and shock resistance.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetModsuitMedical = medical MOD helmet
    .desc = A lightweight suit by DeForest Medical Corporation that allows for easier movement.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetModsuitMining = mining MOD helmet
    .desc = A NanoTrasen mining suit for on-site operations, fitted with accreting ash armor and a spherical form.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetModsuitRescue = rescue MOD helmet
    .desc = An advanced version of DeForest Medical Corporation's medical suit, designed for quick rescue from the most dangerous environments.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetModsuitSecurity = security MOD helmet
    .desc = An Apadyne Technologies security suit that offers greater speed at the cost of carrying capacity.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetModsuitStandard = standard MOD helmet
    .desc = A civilian-class suit by Nakamura Engineering that offers little beyond slightly faster movement.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetModsuitCaptain = captain MOD helmet
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetModsuitCE = chief engineer MOD helmet
    .desc = An atmospheric-resistant suit by Nakamura Engineering, offering extreme heat resistance compared to the engineer suit.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetModsuitRD = research director MOD helmet
    .desc = A helmet for a MODsuit.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetModsuitInquisitor = inquisitor MOD helmet
    .desc = A helmet for a MODsuit.
